<title>THAILAND: Thai sugar vessel movements on April 10.</title>
<headline>Thai sugar vessel movements on April 10.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent surveyors detailed Thai sugar freight movement as follows (in tonne tel quels):</p>
<p>Vessel		  Position	  Quantity    Destination</p>
<p>Xuan Cheng	    SLD Apr 05	12,000	Srilanka</p>
<p>Du Man Gang	   SLD Apr 04	 8,000	Indonesia</p>
<p>As Salaam	     SLD Apr 05	14,000	Iran</p>
